# Enforce LF line endings in the repository and on checkout across all platforms.
# This prevents Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) from converting templates and
# other text files to CRLF, which would cause Thymeleaf and similar renderers
# to emit CRLF in HTTP response bodies, breaking cross-platform tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark binary formats so git never mangles them.
*.jar binary
*.class binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.war binary
*.ear binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
